            <trans-unit id="iIWC3BD">
                <source>description.guided_project_card_back</source>
                <target>Create a variant of the card backs, which players can win or buy for every pack, then choose, and put it on sale if you wish.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="LRGZYLV">
                <source>description.guided_project_card_back_picture</source>
                <target>Give a back its picture for one pack: that castle at dawn, under the snow… Without one, the back takes the pack's picture.</target>
